(INGREDIA USER MANUAL) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia is an iPhone app that helps users check packaged food products against a ) Tj
T*
(personal allergy or intolerance profile. The app scans a barcode, looks up product ) Tj
T*
(information, compares that information with the active profile, and may suggest ) Tj
T*
(alternative products in the same category.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia is a decision-support tool only. It does not guarantee that a product is safe. ) Tj
T*
(Always check the packaging, ingredients list, allergen statement, and the manufacturer’s) Tj
T*
( latest information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MAIN TABS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia has four main tabs:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• `Skann` / `Scan`: Scan a product barcode and review the result.) Tj
T*
(• `Historikk` / `History`: Open previously scanned products.) Tj
T*
(• `Restaurantkort` / `Restaurant Card`: Show an allergy card based on the active ) Tj
T*
(profile.) Tj
T*
(• `Profil` / `Profile`: Manage allergy settings, cross-contamination preference, ) Tj
T*
(language, and notes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEFORE FIRST USE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Open the `Profil` tab.) Tj
T*
(2. Review the default profile or create a new one.) Tj
T*
(3. Select the allergens or intolerances that apply.) Tj
T*
(4. Decide whether `may contain traces of` warnings should be treated as unacceptable.) Tj
T*
(5. Optionally add a restaurant note for staff.) Tj
T*
(6. Choose the app language.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The app creates a default profile automatically if none exists.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CAMERA PERMISSION) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia uses the iPhone camera to scan barcodes. The app requires camera access the ) Tj
T*
(first time scanning is used.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If scanning does not open correctly:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Open iPhone `Settings`.) Tj
T*
(2. Find `Ingredia`.) Tj
T*
(3. Confirm that camera access is enabled.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
