() Tj
T*
(SUPPORTED BARCODE TYPES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia currently scans these barcode formats:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• `EAN-8`) Tj
T*
(• `EAN-13`) Tj
T*
(• `UPC-E`) Tj
T*
(• `Code 128`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(HOW TO SCAN A PRODUCT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Open the `Skann` / `Scan` tab.) Tj
T*
(2. Tap the main scan button.) Tj
T*
(3. Place the barcode inside the camera frame.) Tj
T*
(4. Hold the phone steady until the app detects the code.) Tj
T*
(5. Wait while Ingredia fetches product information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If a product is found, the result screen opens automatically.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If the product cannot be found or the request fails, Ingredia shows an error message.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(UNDERSTANDING THE RESULT SCREEN) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The result screen is designed to answer six questions:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. What product was scanned?) Tj
T*
(2. Is there a conflict with the active profile?) Tj
T*
(3. Why did the app reach that conclusion?) Tj
T*
(4. How complete is the available product data?) Tj
T*
(5. What should still be checked on the packaging?) Tj
T*
(6. Are there better alternatives?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PRODUCT SUMMARY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The top section shows:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• Product name) Tj
T*
(• Brand) Tj
T*
(• Barcode) Tj
T*
(• Product image when available) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ASSESSMENT LEVELS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia may show one of these result levels:) Tj
ET
endstream
