() Tj
T*
(• `Ingen registrerte konflikter` / `No registered conflicts`) Tj
T*
(• `Kontroller produktet` / `Check the product`) Tj
T*
(• `Ikke anbefalt` / `Not recommended`) Tj
T*
(• `For lite informasjon` / `Too little information`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These levels are based on the active profile and the available product data.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHY A PRODUCT WAS FLAGGED) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If Ingredia detects possible conflicts, it lists the matching allergens and whether they) Tj
T*
( appear as:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• a registered ingredient or allergen) Tj
T*
(• a trace or cross-contamination warning) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If the profile is set to reject trace warnings, a matching `may contain` warning can ) Tj
T*
(make the product `Not recommended`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DATA CONFIDENCE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia also shows a `Datagrunnlag` / `Data confidence` section for the scanned ) Tj
T*
(product.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Possible values:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• `Høy datakvalitet` / `High data quality`) Tj
T*
(• `Begrenset informasjon` / `Limited information`) Tj
T*
(• `Ukjent datagrunnlag` / `Unknown data basis`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This section helps explain how complete the available ingredient, allergen, and category) Tj
T*
( data appears to be. It may also show the latest known product update date when that ) Tj
T*
(information exists.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(IMPORTANT REMINDER) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Even when Ingredia finds no registered conflict, users should still verify:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• the ingredients list) Tj
T*
(• allergen statements) Tj
T*
(• trace warnings) Tj
T*
(• recent packaging changes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BETTER ALTERNATIVES) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
