1 0 0 1 54 738 Tm
(If the scanned product has a conflict or should be checked, Ingredia may show `Bedre ) Tj
T*
(alternativer` / `Better alternatives`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Alternative suggestions are built from products in the same or a similar category and ) Tj
T*
(are evaluated against the full active profile, not only one allergen.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia prefers alternatives that:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• do not conflict with the active profile) Tj
T*
(• respect the trace-warning preference) Tj
T*
(• match the scanned product category) Tj
T*
(• have more complete product data) Tj
T*
(• have newer product data when available) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia may label an alternative as:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• `Fra historikk` / `From history`) Tj
T*
(• `Fra Open Food Facts` / `From Open Food Facts`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Users can also hide unclear suggestions with the `Hide unknown suggestions` filter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(HISTORY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The `Historikk` / `History` tab stores previously scanned products locally on the ) Tj
T*
(device.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(From this screen, users can:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• review earlier scans) Tj
T*
(• reopen a product result) Tj
T*
(• see the last scanned date) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If the same barcode is scanned again later, Ingredia fetches live product data again and) Tj
T*
( updates the local record.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PROFILES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The `Profil` / `Profile` tab supports multiple profiles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Users can:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• switch the active profile) Tj
T*
(• create a new profile) Tj
T*
(• duplicate a profile) Tj
T*
(• delete a profile when more than one exists) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
