T*
() Tj
T*
(RESTAURANT CARD) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The `Restaurantkort` / `Restaurant Card` tab creates a visual card based on the active ) Tj
T*
(profile.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(It shows:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• the selected allergens) Tj
T*
(• a cross-contamination warning when enabled) Tj
T*
(• an optional restaurant note) Tj
T*
(• a reminder to verify ingredients and preparation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This card is meant to be shown to restaurant staff. It supports the current app ) Tj
T*
(languages:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• Norwegian) Tj
T*
(• English) Tj
T*
(• Thai) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHERE THE PRODUCT INFORMATION COMES FROM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia currently uses `Open Food Facts` as its product data source.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The app uses live network requests to:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• fetch the scanned product) Tj
T*
(• search for alternative products in similar categories) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia also stores scanned and viewed products locally so they remain available in ) Tj
T*
(history.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(INTERNATIONAL USE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia uses the global Open Food Facts database, so it can work abroad.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Important limitations:) Tj
T*
() Tj
