(• product coverage varies by country) Tj
T*
(• some markets have more complete data than others) Tj
T*
(• category quality may vary) Tj
T*
(• missing or outdated records can affect results) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(International support should therefore be treated as useful but not equally reliable in ) Tj
T*
(every country.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OFFLINE AND NETWORK BEHAVIOR) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Current behavior:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• scanning and fresh product lookup require internet access) Tj
T*
(• previously stored products remain available locally in history) Tj
T*
(• the app is not yet a full offline product database) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If there is no connection, Ingredia may show an offline or timeout error instead of ) Tj
T*
(fresh results.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TROUBLESHOOTING) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(THE SCANNER DOES NOT WORK) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• Confirm camera permission is enabled in iPhone settings.) Tj
T*
(• Make sure the barcode is well lit and fully visible.) Tj
T*
(• Try moving the phone slightly closer or farther away.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(THE PRODUCT IS NOT FOUND) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• The barcode may not exist in Open Food Facts.) Tj
T*
(• The code may be valid but not yet available in the database.) Tj
T*
(• Try scanning again with better focus.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(THE RESULT SEEMS INCOMPLETE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• Some products have missing ingredient or allergen data.) Tj
T*
(• Open Food Facts is a public database and quality varies.) Tj
T*
(• Always compare the result with the package label.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(NO ALTERNATIVES APPEAR) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• The product may not have enough category data.) Tj
T*
(• Similar products may not exist in the available database.) Tj
T*
(• Candidate products may be rejected because they conflict with the active profile.) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
