(SAFETY NOTICE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ingredia must not be used as the only basis for a medical or dietary decision.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Always:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(• read the package) Tj
T*
(• verify the manufacturer’s latest information) Tj
T*
(• treat unknown or limited data with caution) Tj
T*
(• use extra care for severe allergies and cross-contamination risk) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(VERSION SCOPE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This manual describes the current MVP behavior in the project as of `August 28, 2026`.) Tj
